# Claude Code
claude.md
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# The whole .claude/ directory stays local. It holds the working notes
# (SESSION_PROMPTS.md), tool permissions, and the project docs — API_KEYS.md,
# MEMORY.md and TOOLING.md. They live on disk for whoever works on the project;
# they are not published with the site.
.claude/

# Angular
.angular/

# Angular CLI scaffolding that this project does not use. Left on disk so the CLI
# stays happy, kept out of the repository because it is not ours: client/README.md
# is the generator's boilerplate, and the root README is the real one.
#
# app.spec.ts used to be listed here too — it was the generated example test, written
# against the placeholder component replaced on day one, and it failed. It has since
# been rewritten against the real masthead and belongs in the suite.
client/README.md

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
